<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 8 }}>INSTALL PYTHON</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 24 }}>安装 Python：官网直装 or Anaconda（推荐）</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 28 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 3, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '30px 32px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 18 }}>
          <FAIcon name='globe' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F' }}>方式一：官网直装</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1B2733', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
          · python.org 下载安装包<br />
          · 勾选 Add to PATH<br />
          · 验证：python --version
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 4, background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 14, padding: '30px 32px' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 18 }}>
          <FAIcon name='star' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>方式二：Anaconda（推荐）</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
          · 国内用清华源下载<br />
          · 内置 conda 环境管理<br />
          · 方便切换 Python 版本
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 18, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#22D3EE', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", monospace' }}>
            bash Anaconda3-xxx.sh
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 20, background: '#DCE7F5', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 22px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
        环境管理是新手第一课：一个项目一个环境，互不污染
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', width: 'calc(100% - 120px)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 2 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>04 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
